+
+Transfer rules: only an org admin of `{orgID}` may transfer (other org in the
+path → 404, non-admin → 403); the user must belong to `{orgID}` (else 404) and
+the destination must be a different, existing organization (else 400). To keep
+the model rules (members belong to the project's org), the transfer removes the
+user's project memberships, unassigns their tasks and clears their org-admin
+flag, all in one transaction.
 
